  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:89761",
  "description": "The skopeo command lets you inspect images from container image registries, get images and image layers, and use signatures to create and verify files.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * podman: Arbitrary file write when importing OCI archive (CVE-2025-11395)\n  * net/[http:](http:) golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n  * crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
